  "engineering_observations": [
    "Normal hover references are roughly 322 A at 165 kg and 367 A at 180 kg on the 66.6 V system convention; 500 A is the frozen continuous pack capability and 1050 A is a 3 s stress point, not normal hover.",
    "A single 0.2 mOhm series element is already 50 W at 500 A and 220.5 W instantaneous at 1050 A, so milli-ohm-scale component data must be treated as a system thermal budget.",
    "Copper geometry arithmetic alone does not establish ampacity; terminals, insulation, enclosure airflow, joints and contact hot-spots remain qualification items.",
